  "_design": "Overlord DAir light landing lag (10 frames at 60 fps). Touchdown during early tuck (f0-f2 of DAir): compact ball touches floor at f0 (pelvis loc z -47, feet under pelvis at x \u00c2\u00b112 y 12 z 14). Feet slide down and out to stance (x \u00c2\u00b124, y 4) across f1-f2 as pelvis compresses to -50. Rise starts at f4 led by head (+8 -> 0), spine unfolds (-20 -> -2), and pelvis rises smoothly out of f2 through f6 (-20) to settle at f8 (-8) and f9 (-6) ready to blend to idle. Arms stay crossed at sternum throughout.",
